(5.2 Formats) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Every email must be a valid email address.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Phone numbers contain digits only; spaces and dashes are removed before the check.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (The importer accepts common date formats.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (5.3 Field rules) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Column | Required | Rule) Tj
T* (Email | yes | must be a valid email address) Tj
T* (Name | yes | at most 120 characters) Tj
T* (Phone | no | digits only after spaces and dashes are removed) Tj
T* (Company | no | at most 200 characters) Tj
T* (Date of birth | no | a date in the past) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (5.4 Rejected rows) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (A row that fails validation is not imported. It is listed in the error report with its row) Tj
T* (number, the column and the reason.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Error messages must be user-friendly.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (6 Duplicates) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Rows whose email matches an existing customer are skipped.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (When two rows in the same file have the same email, the first row is imported and the) Tj
T* (later rows are reported as duplicates.) Tj
T* () Tj
