T* () Tj
T* (Before anything is imported, the admin sees a preview of the first 20 rows, each with its) Tj
T* (validation result.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (The preview also shows how many rows will be imported, skipped and rejected.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (The admin can cancel at the preview. Nothing is imported after a cancel.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (8 Importing) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (8.1 Running the import) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (When the admin confirms the preview, the importer writes every valid row as a new) Tj
T* (customer.) Tj
